$Mission Desc:
 XSTR("[[Duration: ~12 min | Difficulty: Hard]] The freighter Hesper and the passenger liner Pilgrim Mercy made a bad jump and are dead in space with their drives cooked, eleven minutes from the Theseus. The Bolitho frigate Halyard and three Assault Raptors jumped in to help, but the Cylons found them first and they keep coming. Keep the Hesper and the Pilgrim Mercy alive until the battlestar jumps in.", -1)
$end_multi_text

